'''Water Kung Fu (formerly known as Fishman Karate)''' is a [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] obtainable in all seas.

The style focuses on steam and water based abilities, also letting the user M1 far faster than any other fighting style.

Water Kung Fu is considered by many as one of best fighting styles for grinding because the M1s have no cooldown and do not make the user lunge forward (Unlike its upgrade, [[Sharkman Karate]]).

==Obtainment==
Water Kung Fu can be learned for {{Money|750,000}} from the [[Water Kung-fu Teacher]].

==Mastery==
* '''300+ Mastery:''' Water Kung Fu is one of the requirements to obtain [[Superhuman]](in [[Second Sea]] or [[Third Sea]]).
* '''400+ Mastery:''' Water Kung Fu can be "upgraded" to [[Sharkman Karate]] in [[Second Sea]] (or [[Third Sea]]).

