==Trivia==
* Water Kung Fu is the most expensive fighting style in the [[First Sea]].
** Additionally, it has the same price as [[Instinct]] and [[Soul Cane]].
* The unreworked version of '''[X] Deadly Shower''' is used by [[Sea Beast]]s but much larger.
* The '''[X] Deadly Shower''' has almost the range of the ground to the top of [[Castle on the Sea]].
* People use this fighting style, since [[Sharkman Karate]] got nerfed with it's M1s being slow other than this being faster (In grinding, people still use this for PvP).
* Water Kung Fu does not have any moves that cause [[Destructible Physics]].

